kmp-bigdecimal
Copyright (c) 2026 Sören Johansson

This library is an independent implementation of arbitrary-precision decimal
arithmetic for Kotlin Multiplatform.

It is not a fork of, and contains no implementation code copied from,
ArtificialPB/bignum-kt, ionspin/kotlin-multiplatform-bignum, java.math, or any
other big-number library. The public API intentionally follows familiar
BigDecimal conventions so that it is easy to learn and migrate to.

See PROVENANCE.md for the provenance and similarity audit.
